stroke path.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]agent_cli_update_history.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/agent_cli_update_history.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-el[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-el/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Durable agent-CLI update run journal[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]journal[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]journal: add the bounded JSONL run journal under ~/.sase/logs, define [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the run/entry records and the UpdateTrigger enum, record every run from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the single execute_agent_cli_updates choke point with a best-effort [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]writer that can never fail an update, and thread the trigger through the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]three call sites.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pane load path, config, and session state[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]plumbing[dim] · [dim][/dim]after journal[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plumbing: read a bounded tail of the journal inside the existing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]off-thread Updates load worker, carry it on PluginsLoadResult into pane [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]state, add the two ace.updates config keys and the session-scoped [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]history-scope flag, and mount the history Static with its TCSS so the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render phase has a surface to paint into.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]History panel rendering and scope toggle[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]render[dim] · [dim][/dim]after plumbing[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render: build the per-CLI and all-CLIs history renderables with their [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]glyph/color palette, relative timestamps derived from the load clock, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]trigger badges, truncation footer, and empty/error states, and wire the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]H scope toggle with its check_action gating and repaint path.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Help, docs, and visual goldens[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after render[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]polish: document the panel and journal in the help modal, the ACE guide,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the agent-providers guide, and the configuration reference, record the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]three new PNG goldens, and land a green just check.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-el","hidden":false,"llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-el.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-e497a3bf5c15a100198a10d448b0bdcd","started_at":"2026-08-03T06:54:18.945654","state":"dismissed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785761032,"sha":"a086b0f30ecef9cf0f66891695650fd165fd8f5d","subject":"feat(agent-clis): render update history panel"}],"dismissed_at":"2026-08-03T08:44:31.922025","files":{"chat":{"digest":"9478401462c6a508217125e5d0f8b842681b652775cc6989ff7756f6b978b6c7","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-el.3/chat.md","size_bytes":8197},"commits":{"digest":"dbe29377437ceee5a968b64b3f78f81f8b3720047a37c4becd3be366627ae298","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-el.3/commits.json","size_bytes":223},"meta":{"digest":"ecaac2b053f3e0e591c03673055d4c1080390dde35c6bfa7ae9c97999178174